      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45a08e9d8508afd5c7852643",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从<jobs_placename>\\n稻荷大人回来了！哦，大获成功哟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56c46abaa6f35b369ce7c403740fe1ddb184ed73e18a17d1cd92cf6c9c4138de",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4179f2c2acab561ae79c996",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从<jobs_placename>\\n回来了哦哦哦——！我回来了————！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcf4e178fb37a5b7a067ecb88b2f518d93fcc4b026a9023c0112b44f9f886977",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b10aea780240631b729e3da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<jobs_placename>结束。\\n结果？…哈，自己去确认吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f17ba03cee421059190267f82566e67a5063c4a12613d5c870f2e5a9ef85297d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28e0bd757ab43113cc8bd59f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从<jobs_placename>\\n刚刚回来。准时。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db92b15bcbf9923c00774900e9efe14b02398b03f66708a65239c7181f90d929",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af057ebdf07587e4ec39c8a2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "#<jobs_placename>\\n#大成功 #我回来了☆ #欢迎回来 #快说说♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b32b9367ea9144e9a3117aac16d64753c3edab145119bd1e0d6da047606f6535",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb0ace20f870a5aa9d99caf0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从<jobs_placename>\\n回来了哟！把会场气氛炒得热火朝天呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "40fb6fc3e17932b4231c987e301179e0fab24186952c3cb9fc17679f0177a5dd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0f245330500bbd02aa5ed22",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<jobs_placename>\\n已经结束了。快点给我下一个安排。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79c05fa01de89ba989ceffb7cfb99808a40862256e672f13334ce616d2af0d03",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1e5f0dbbe5fc27b776e866d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从<jobs_placename>归还！\\n下一个目的地是？我会用爆心速度搞定！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "409dc3ef735481a745884e42b5b7553c7c60836d2973bf0ddca2848f0f53997d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7856e6719f131acf89ec7e96",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从<jobs_placename>\\nI'm back.　真是一次愉快的小旅程。",
      "source_fingerprint": "909f1b5fd402e52cc745e35e6fadc419442fe9b3efce2a4b957784691c0e2ae1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91a69db150ca75637b1d533d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从<jobs_placename>\\n回来了，小弟！快来迎接我～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1148136e8a2b094b30ca825d77567b09221feda99bb5c4aac46a5d0b049471b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13fc5b00b986e9a3043f1c80",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使魔！<jobs_placename>\\n已经腻了！下次带我去别的地方！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dfb4e587218e85f147833ddf961d116ff89365aa768d82875edc38cbc5201a7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1044"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fabe5912b4632f55c29a7e16",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从<jobs_placename>\\n回来了哟…呼呼…你没觉得寂寞吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd90277f796fda54105e9c6c397535d78ae6da58e13176d5e9f4bb342af83251",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1045"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:640b00a393dc840e4b57e1a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "成功啦♪马娘偶像飞鹰子・巡演\\nIN <jobs_placename>☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "fca49a41df56f80fbe89d69e225527fe6c59fc20b3b2921824a12d12fedadfb2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b73871da1748eb119277e0c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『<jobs_placename>结束后，\\n冒险者们回到了学园（第7卷643页）』",
      "source_fingerprint": "1255ab8f2f0a99381a02975c3fa2f5d55f85875028028e8fb33c3258d1d82433",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3974220e2d9af3148cf33a1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<jobs_placename>\\n结束啦！真的累死我了～我辛苦了～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "086eeeb34b1b8902f9cb5852a6eaf6439c67a81c0c2bb96af2dcc2f9dd675631",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1048"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cb847a2e47a73234af9ef73",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<jobs_placename>\\n你觉得结果怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f1f6b6ec5206f9fa8d8b340c07373296c70ba3666d66a20ecf4cd7fe446e460",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c1a485603990505820a59ab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<jobs_placename>结束了。\\n不用来迎接我。…真的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e74ff43fde2857acf8db391fba0952e73f0b0959958388d71a6c98f2923ce55",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:622d0bf69304af3c1dd79bf7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<jobs_placename>，结束了，\\n！还有…带了特产回来哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3139eaadcea99cbfcd77c202a13ac8182f96860e65b9b1099970fa8b1f663d25",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e24b5cab091553f75fedf15",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我回来了！！好开心！诶哆诶哆…\\n对，<jobs_placename>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e1591f5ef599a07eb6ddbb1aac25ed2ba45c2b84f41df4e4ddf13b0a05f0885",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1052"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0b9d721ad514f1859cb8d74",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从<jobs_placename>\\n回来了斯！来汇报结果斯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cb8ddf2da0c7b7f5b1a3975b8307f26e319fa8eda7888e51e85f34e834e221b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1053"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78bf0676dcc058e8f57991ce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<jobs_placename>作战\\n大成功！让大家都笑容满面了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25bf173f30553d07027f04f6a6a2414868932c587520abafe9b510fae0a4322e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1054"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93f7f742ee397d2c884ce73e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在<jobs_placename>\\n找到的Marvelous☆分给训练员★☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "eebecbf41e92caa0a3b89dd89c3c3450cec11963038879985873b0b65c4d3ee1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1055"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba6c1e9d2a4d3c035aa52f1b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<jobs_placename>\\n开运满开大繁盛！这也是白兴大人的指引呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "20078c15eb042175fe7c3e9bbf8ff8bddb675c3bac731344ebde9cfc5151e76b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1056"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88700437fff7d6b4d02bccae",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<jobs_placename>\\n很开心哦。下次——啊，下次去那里吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8043bed2e15150d3b23cb6e2c18a75677bd979ce4d579711e342314a8347d9e3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1057"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8af0b2d21f287fd0dc364f06",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "总算从<jobs_placename>\\n回来了——呀啊啊～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbd17db69e6fe9bf97468875485ea3753fc9008bd49335aec4635eb650f19ff0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1058"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dceb0b7ef3efd415ac5dd0fc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从<jobs_placename>\\n回来了。有事想报告，待会儿来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b680f99283b7b943ffa45d39983a420bf741fb66f46712a886a9424373103d34",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1059"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42cf663e2da0a7176c41af49",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从<jobs_placename>\\n回来了～。呼，远行真是够呛啊～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "128a0382c23c190ee384d1db0556d5d002858bfbc282a780fbd23589e9a4f0d4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1060"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91f698fb5ac8e9ee90a77dff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<jobs_placename>\\n成功了啦。哼，对我来说这都小菜一碟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d888611069ec31b98d7b84fc6b9d7f0247a7ac0cfa437809030c29af3a7b7b63",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3653effa9b19929e6c76d0fb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<jobs_placename>，\\n全力带动气氛啦～～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8d65b3fffd2e29cbd96c9026c8814c5ba6c13ebd8f9e9aca03f6d0ea42ecc02",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1062"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:601b24f0cb0c264da8504f03",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从<jobs_placename>\\n刚刚回来。下次什么时候出发？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4247714b461c7a15c5917c416f7ffa87e3d5650cf1efa25cc0d7205a922239e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1063"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7188d813a5b4686ff7c24c17",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<jobs_placename>结束喽\\n大概『爆嗨』…气氛炒起来了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "55a6856d32c1ae65b3129823bf4c9592eef4c5659af72551efb0ce0f40139b03",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1064"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5933349e94ebcedaa5fce191",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "LANE：发送给你\\n<jobs_placename>结束",
      "source_fingerprint": "c276fa31e26eb8b10876be649ec64302329752885c7bde21da1474319a5b5a10",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1065"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fa53328ba9946753e7748bd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呼——哈——全力以赴完成了…！\\n<jobs_placename>…！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "76a5921e9c0eda59fdd8c8cf5090d5119ec2dfab2c851e81368071dc8b02ea38",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1066"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f87e0cf8cc090291397d3ff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "让<jobs_placename>的所有人\\n都感到开心，是一次精彩的演出♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "74f25faf8a1f723bab2eab9785130c3b90b7f29d49ab698d4aad13a0a6b740d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1067"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:071474b5928e7c6d28e596f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从<jobs_placename>\\n回来了！我SOYASOYA地带动气氛啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3454c4f31fe9b3bea231e8b1381b7ba8dfcea861209208206f0f8fcec561b343",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1068"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b90d61903554acd2a7bd35bc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从<jobs_placename>\\n回来了！气氛如花盛开一样热烈♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4507da190d9dbe66bdf0dc5854a08bbb9a42ed1385271fe56390800ccc9839e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1069"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a56bcaadb7848acdca2c32c6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喂，从<jobs_placename>\\n主人回来了。摇尾巴来迎接吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad23c0a278f0372ac32a4c208eb4cc8e158bb0dfe4e17c121268c4e3e317357c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1070"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8078530d599249da075245cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要是能把我的光辉\\n展现给<jobs_placename>的大家就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa731a219d55b8d842e47a2f01875361aa4be6f2fedeb9629341fa4cb6621198",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d04e5231c1833a2788d63363",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从<jobs_placename>\\n刚刚归来。算是一次很好的修行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "063d0d00aac816d853cecf4d0cf3d3fa2c95af590599b9d10fc143d153bd4e99",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1072"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80dfeb64d579a8f4eedee58f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<jobs_placename>，\\n我可是让现场彻底火爆了一把！",
      "source_fingerprint": "413aea845dc3ac58c8cf07ba6b3dc20c134c4ac10ef08ced9c4efb270f45b2b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1073"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beac91e9eb10fd860d8d1638",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从<jobs_placename>\\n回来了～♪转眼就结束啦～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb2dc51764875bd625a05551d4303dce8aba011fb03e43c68fa36cfc6419b045",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1074"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee0bba543d1558f3ac378fb8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我刚从<jobs_placename>\\n回来！让笑颜之樱盛放啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3a7e9cf2c53dbfd5dc2feb349b821d7d9b0c422051a4a2033104f00737f517c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1076"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b1be6e580bc34a573e35d22",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<jobs_placename>，完成了。\\n今后也想回应大家的期待呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a7f6aba3ad9964d0513846cc2a51a5dbd938453a5883a79068af7a517a2ab72",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1077"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41c2178f8df8d2693f760d83",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "…从<jobs_placename>\\n又回到你身边…我成为了光风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0800312f7610f1726d23bf124c98857da40280b54866648b5cf2a37984e86284",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1078"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e96b6ad4f8db4579fb416b66",
